  ("The IO monad, and indeed any Monad, can be made Applicative by taking pure =" 0.2130 0.7988 0.5285 0.5391 0.5391 0.0105 0.00479 0.3180 0.0288 "NSCVXQ+CMR10" 0.0118 nil nil 14)
